00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:45.529
Continue to believe in
whatever your one word is,

00:14:45.529 --> 00:14:47.362
and I'll see you soon.

00:14:53.501 --> 00:14:57.418
- Information expands
our awareness of what is.

00:15:00.429 --> 00:15:02.806
So through the Google network,

00:15:02.806 --> 00:15:05.073
which is the biggest search engine,

00:15:05.073 --> 00:15:09.182
we expand our awareness,
but there's another thing

00:15:09.182 --> 00:15:11.252
that people don't understand.

00:15:11.252 --> 00:15:15.419
Our state of awareness actually
chooses the information

00:15:16.485 --> 00:15:17.902
that we seek out.

00:15:20.205 --> 00:15:24.267
So if my state of awareness
says I want to understand

00:15:24.267 --> 00:15:28.017
the causes of war,
terrorism, global warming,

00:15:28.983 --> 00:15:32.233
social injustice, economic injustice...

00:15:33.705 --> 00:15:36.414
All the things that are
kind of surfacing now

00:15:36.414 --> 00:15:40.551
as what's happening in Syria
and all the Middle East,

00:15:40.551 --> 00:15:44.301
the so-called Arab Spring
occupy Wall Street,

00:15:44.301 --> 00:15:47.765
then my state of awareness,
looking at this global picture,

00:15:47.765 --> 00:15:50.765
will seek out the right information.

00:15:50.765 --> 00:15:53.182
They core feed on each other.

00:15:54.657 --> 00:15:57.528
The information expands
awareness, but the state

00:15:57.528 --> 00:16:00.666
of awareness also expands
the information we seek.

00:16:00.666 --> 00:16:02.339
- [Interviewer] Sure.

00:16:02.339 --> 00:16:04.159
- And if by awareness,
I mean spirituality,

00:16:04.159 --> 00:16:06.811
which is my definition,
then awareness has many more

00:16:06.811 --> 00:16:09.144
components than information.

00:16:10.773 --> 00:16:13.440
Awareness influences your moods.

00:16:14.826 --> 00:16:18.993
If you're depressed, then
everything looks dark and bleak.

00:16:20.158 --> 00:16:22.352
It influences your beliefs.

00:16:22.352 --> 00:16:24.935
It influences your assumptions.

00:16:25.771 --> 00:16:28.740
It influences your perceptions.

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:31.860
It influences your expectations.

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:36.027
So in the book, my thesis
is that all problems exist

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:41.256
because of what I call
"contracted awareness".

00:16:41.256 --> 00:16:44.255
Contracted awareness
means you feel separate

00:16:44.255 --> 00:16:45.838
from the ecosystem.

00:16:47.005 --> 00:16:48.613
The Google network is an ecosystem.

00:16:48.613 --> 00:16:52.780
You feel separate from the
ecosystem that nurtures

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:56.053
the web of relationships.

00:16:57.098 --> 00:17:01.265
That, then, of course,
results in fear, in anxiety,

00:17:03.633 --> 00:17:07.383
in expectations that
are Doomsday prophecies,

00:17:08.623 --> 00:17:11.277
in assumptions that everything
is going to go wrong,

00:17:11.277 --> 00:17:13.194
and so on and so forth.

00:17:15.293 --> 00:17:19.054
In my mind, the analogy is you
are walking in a dark room.

00:17:19.054 --> 00:17:22.518
You have a candle, that's
the light of your awareness,

00:17:22.518 --> 00:17:25.853
and you keep bumping into stuff.

00:17:25.853 --> 00:17:30.660
And so everything's a problem,
and that's your world.

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:33.545
But now imagine that you can expand

00:17:33.545 --> 00:17:36.317
that candle's light of awareness,

00:17:36.317 --> 00:17:40.529
so now you have a flashlight
and you can move around,

00:17:40.529 --> 00:17:43.269
and everything that
seemed like an obstacle

00:17:43.269 --> 00:17:44.911
actually has a purpose.

00:17:44.911 --> 00:17:47.948
This has a purpose, this has a purpose,

00:17:47.948 --> 00:17:50.111
that screen has a purpose.

00:17:50.111 --> 00:17:54.278
So all problems are now
opportunities for some purpose.

00:17:56.051 --> 00:17:57.654
So that's expanded awareness,

00:17:57.654 --> 00:18:01.449
you now feel connected to
the web of relationships.

00:18:01.449 --> 00:18:04.102
So some thoughts, some
beliefs, are limiting.

00:18:04.102 --> 00:18:05.809
I will never be good enough.

00:18:05.809 --> 00:18:07.725
I will never successful.

00:18:07.725 --> 00:18:09.308
I'll never be rich.

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:14.390
I'll never have a good relationship.

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:17.643
I'm too ugly, I'm not attractive enough,

00:18:17.643 --> 00:18:20.131
I'm not thin enough, et cetera.

00:18:20.131 --> 00:18:22.536
Remember, these thoughts
don't belong to you.

00:18:22.536 --> 00:18:26.087
So you have to, whenever
you have these thoughts,

00:18:26.087 --> 00:18:29.098
you should ask yourself, is it true?

00:18:29.098 --> 00:18:31.848
How am I so sure if this is true?

00:18:32.953 --> 00:18:35.286
Is this thought limiting me?

00:18:36.324 --> 00:18:40.294
How could I go beyond this limitation?

00:18:40.294 --> 00:18:44.314
What is a thought that is more empowering?

00:18:44.314 --> 00:18:46.798
How can I create that thought?

00:18:46.798 --> 00:18:50.965
Better still, go into the
deepest part of your being,

00:18:53.081 --> 00:18:54.913
which is just silence.

00:18:54.913 --> 00:18:57.044
When the thought intrudes,

00:18:57.044 --> 00:19:00.461
say it doesn't belong to me, let it pass.

00:19:02.189 --> 00:19:05.091
Observe your thoughts arise and subside

00:19:05.091 --> 00:19:07.073
like waves on the ocean.

00:19:07.073 --> 00:19:08.589
You are not the waves.

00:19:08.589 --> 00:19:11.257
Although you get conditioned by the waves,

00:19:11.257 --> 00:19:13.660
you are the mighty ocean itself.

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:15.511
You are not just a drop in the ocean,

00:19:15.511 --> 00:19:18.464
you are the ocean in the drop itself.

00:19:18.464 --> 00:19:21.935
And in the depths of
the ocean is infinity.

00:19:21.935 --> 00:19:26.102
And you are the infinite
mind, conditioned to society

00:19:28.108 --> 00:19:31.858
and culture and religion
into the local mind.

00:19:32.876 --> 00:19:35.709
Is this not enough to convince you

00:19:36.855 --> 00:19:39.981
that your thoughts don't belong to you?

00:19:39.981 --> 00:19:42.005
When you take ownership of your thoughts,

00:19:42.005 --> 00:19:44.863
then you get bamboozled by hypnosis

00:19:44.863 --> 00:19:46.548
of social condition.

00:19:46.548 --> 00:19:50.215
By the hypnosis of of
cultural conditioning.

00:19:52.211 --> 00:19:54.825
There is no originality in that.

00:19:54.825 --> 00:19:56.724
There is no creativity in that.

00:19:56.724 --> 00:19:58.205
There is no love in that.

00:19:58.205 --> 00:20:00.234
It's all conditioned love.

00:20:00.234 --> 00:20:04.401
So please please understand
that you are the infinite being.

00:20:07.836 --> 00:20:11.753
You are the universe
having a human experience,

00:20:13.525 --> 00:20:16.775
but the human experience is conditioned

00:20:18.074 --> 00:20:21.574
by labels, by definitions, by evaluations,

00:20:23.689 --> 00:20:27.022
by judgements, by opinions, and by words

00:20:30.886 --> 00:20:33.053
that you heard as a child.

00:20:36.538 --> 00:20:39.870
It's difficult to break
out of this prison,

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:42.606
because if you're in a real
prison, a so-called real prison,

00:20:42.606 --> 00:20:44.773
at least you see the bars.

00:20:46.134 --> 00:20:49.301
In this prison, which is the hypnosis

00:20:49.301 --> 00:20:51.191
of social conditioning,

00:20:51.191 --> 00:20:54.324
the hypnosis of cultural conditioning,

00:20:54.324 --> 00:20:57.505
you are in a prison that has no walls,

00:20:57.505 --> 00:21:01.634
and, therefore, you don't
realize that you're in a prison,

00:21:01.634 --> 00:21:05.384
and, therefore, you have
no desire to escape.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:10.739
But if you escaped, you
would find the true mind.

00:21:10.739 --> 00:21:12.213
You would find the true self.

00:21:12.213 --> 00:21:16.200
You would find who you really
are, and you would be free.

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:19.434
The ticket to freedom is
not to own your thoughts.

00:21:19.434 --> 00:21:23.517
The ticket to freedom is
to find the source field

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:30.963
within you, which is the
source field of the universe.

00:21:30.963 --> 00:21:35.144
I like to quote Rumi when
he said, Rumi is so great.

00:21:35.144 --> 00:21:37.795
He says why do you stay in prison?

00:21:37.795 --> 00:21:41.912
Why do you stay in prison
when the door is wide open?

00:21:41.912 --> 00:21:46.079
Why do you stay in prison
when the door is wide open?

00:21:49.134 --> 00:21:51.951
Please do not stay in this prison.

00:21:51.951 --> 00:21:54.879
Ask yourself who am I in the middle

00:21:54.879 --> 00:21:57.454
of all this thought traffic?

00:21:57.454 --> 00:22:01.624
That's what Rumi also
says in one of his poems.

00:22:01.624 --> 00:22:05.791
Who am I in the middle of
all of this though traffic?

00:22:07.446 --> 00:22:11.165
And who you are is the
immeasurable potential

00:22:11.165 --> 00:22:15.332
of all that was, all that is,
and all that will ever be.

00:22:16.629 --> 00:22:19.546
True success comes from self-power.

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:21.873
I'll repeat that.

00:22:21.873 --> 00:22:25.417
True success comes from self power.

00:22:25.417 --> 00:22:29.548
True success is defined as
the progressive realization

00:22:29.548 --> 00:22:33.715
of worthy goals, the ability
to love and have compassion,

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:39.627
and to be in touch with the
creative power inside you,

00:22:41.642 --> 00:22:44.521
the ultimate and supreme
genius that mirrors

00:22:44.521 --> 00:22:46.771
the wisdom of the universe.

00:22:48.193 --> 00:22:50.776
Self-power is true self-esteem.

00:22:53.695 --> 00:22:56.200
Self-power is not agency power.

00:22:56.200 --> 00:23:00.367
Agency power is outside power
that comes from a title,

00:23:02.608 --> 00:23:06.275
from a bank account or
money, from contacts,

00:23:08.644 --> 00:23:12.811
or what you might say your
network of connections.

00:23:15.367 --> 00:23:18.537
Agency power is weak because it only lasts

00:23:18.537 --> 00:23:20.870
as long as the agency lasts.

00:23:21.909 --> 00:23:26.427
True power comes from self-esteem,
the core of your being.

00:23:26.427 --> 00:23:29.255
It has the following characteristics.

00:23:29.255 --> 00:23:31.752
When you have true power,
you are independent

00:23:31.752 --> 00:23:34.960
of the good and bad opinions of the world.

00:23:34.960 --> 00:23:38.550
You're immune to criticism and flattery

00:23:38.550 --> 00:23:42.133
but responsive to feedback.
You're fearless.

00:23:43.369 --> 00:23:47.334
You feel beneath no one but
also superior to no one.

00:23:47.334 --> 00:23:50.553
When you come from the core of that being

00:23:50.553 --> 00:23:53.553
and you ask yourself how can I help,

00:23:53.553 --> 00:23:54.896
then you have true power.

